title the cubist sweep opens: five twins on one canvas
prompt Keaton said kg twice on the seated cubist sweep, accepting the two-agent pier; this round opens the sweep's first pass.
think Five classical pages took their cubist twins in one parallel pass -- Ashvini, Chitra, Ardra, Capricorn the sign nature, and the exalted Moon in Taurus -- each showing four faces together per the room's door: the teaching kept whole and cited, the counts the source itself carries with teaching and arithmetic told apart, the working habit the essence feeds, and the one palette pair it wears from kyri/receipt.rye, light terra by day and dark euphoria by night, in the Twilight register with the classical page standing whole beside it.
think The door file gained a pages-so-far roster table, and the commit adds only named paths -- the collision with the concurrent Codex desktop writer taught that a blanket add sweeps a stranger's staged work into your own commit, so this round names every file it stages.
obs Codex desktop finished two session logs and their index rows before going quiet; this commit adopts both logs alongside the rows so every row in the index resolves to a file the tree carries.
obs QA cards on the five twins: 96 95 91 94 93 -- all A, no molt frames; the room's first five pages average 94.
